B.7 Mathematics
Expansions for \(|x| \ll 1\): \[
\begin{aligned}
(1 + x)^{\alpha} &\approx 1 + \alpha x, \qquad \mathrm{e}^x \approx 1 + x + \frac{x^2}{2}, \\
\ln (1 + x) &\approx x - \frac{x^2}{2}, \qquad \sin x \approx x - \frac{x^3}{6}, \\
\cos x &\approx 1 - \frac{x^2}{2}, \qquad \tanh x \approx x.
\end{aligned}
\tag{B.44}\] Roots of a quadratic, and the solution of the harmonic oscillator: \[
\begin{aligned}
a x^2 + b x + c = 0 & \;\Rightarrow\; x = \frac{- b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4 a c}}{2 a}, \\
\ddot{x} = - \omega^2 x & \;\Rightarrow\; x = A \cos \omega t + B \sin \omega t.
\end{aligned}
\tag{B.45}\] Some integrals: \[
\begin{aligned}
& \int_{- \infty}^{\infty} \mathrm{e}^{- x^2} \mathrm{d} x = \sqrt{\pi}, \qquad \int \frac{\mathrm{d} x}{\cosh^2 x} = \tanh x, \\
& \int_0^{\pi} \sin \theta \cos^2 \theta \mathrm{d} \theta = \frac{2}{3}.
\end{aligned}
\tag{B.46}\]
